Hi Avery,

Small product teams don't need a design ops function to have a design system. They need a starting point and a Tuesday morning.

Design systems for teams with one designer
Tuesday, September 22 · 10:00am PT · 30 minutes plus Q&A

We'll cover:
- A 40-component starter kit you can copy into your Figma team
- Variables for spacing, color, and type, set up once
- Keeping code and design in sync with Code Connect
- What to do when engineers build something the design doesn't cover

Presented by Figma's design advocacy team, with a live build.

